# RBAC and Data Integrity

## Roles

| Role | Scope |
| UNICEF_ADMIN | All 20 sites, frameworks, users, aggregates |
| COORDINATOR | Assigned cluster of kindergartens |
| PRINCIPAL | One kindergarten: staff, enrollments, reports |
| TEACHER | Assigned classes: attendance, observations |
| STAFF | Limited operational tasks on one site |
| PARENT | Own children only (read + consented updates) |
| AUDITOR | Read-only cross-site, no PII export without reason |

## Rules

- Enforce role **and** `kindergartenId` on every query/mutation
- Soft-delete child and enrollment records; keep immutable audit logs
- Unique constraints for enrollment codes, staff IDs, and evaluation instrument versions
- All writes record `actorId`, `at`, `action`, `entity`, `before`/`after` hashes
- Fail closed: missing tenant scope returns 403, not an empty unscoped list
